<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13920" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσύρω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tear away,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				416
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				127.19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλυκταίνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philum.
					<u>Ven.</u>
					33.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ -σεσυρμένον</span>”
				<i>torn flesh,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					13.457
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				44.18.2
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἐπάλξεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.43
				</span></i>
			; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς πολεμίους</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τοῦ τείχους</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.15.1
			</span></i>; <i>lay bare, strip,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτωπον ἐς ὀστέον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					22.105
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἐπιπολῆς γῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					34.10.10
				</span></i>
			; <i>skim off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πιμελῶδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					2.13
				</span></i>
			.</div>
